:"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786986549133196001,"creation_channel":"python","deps":[{"link_uuid":"728f96c9-1988-427f-b033-4d26a2a854f4","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"10a3-7dd0-1b3d-47cc"}],"description":"## Context\nRP-01 S5 (ripening-liberal-tuatara, 10a3-7dd0-1b3d-47cc) made the one-operation Pydantic structured-output path authoritative. Its AC-6 is [operator-attested]: direct Anthropic and Bedrock same-run retry/cache canaries. That AC could NOT be executed in the autonomous implementation session because live provider credentials (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY + AWS) were absent. S5 was closed with an honest, transparent --force override; the retry-layer and cache-accounting contract is meanwhile pinned by the offline AC-1/3/4 oracle and documented (AC-8). This ticket tracks running the live canaries when a credentialed operator is available.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] [operator-attested] Direct Anthropic canary: a live structured run over the authoritative one-operation path succeeds with a typed result; the ticket records timestamp, model id, request count, cache read/write/input counts, and the complete-vs-omit branch; no secret appears in output or artifacts.\n- [ ] [operator-attested] Direct Bedrock canary: same, over Bedrock.\n- [ ] Observed cache read/write/input accounting matches the documented contract in docs/llm-framework.md; any divergence is filed as a follow-up.\n\n## Testing\n- Run the canaries with environment-provided credentials; do not print or persist secrets.\n- Cross-check the observed counts against docs/llm-framework.md's retry/accounting section.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f91e-57a2-f790-4ebd","ticket_type":"task","title":"RP-01 AC-6: run live Anthropic+Bedrock structured cache canaries","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["b96d0697-8d16-4839-838d-79f90e90291d","c67cf9f9-a970-4644-9d24-37a7359ed3a7","728f96c9-1988-427f-b033-4d26a2a854f4"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786990068655563352,"uuid":"6491ef3a-7bde-4d41-89a6-a653c87c4f9d"}